
/* PLATDO City: the drive-through menu boards (V13.3). Game only.
 * At a drive-through's menu board the screen shows that place's own menu picture (the owner's artwork, one per brand,
 * in blobs 1253-1267). Point at anything on it and a glowing yellow outline goes round the item (its picture, its words
 * and its price); click it to add it to your order, then order more or order and pay. You can always drive on without
 * ordering. Moving the mouse sways the real camera a little (city-drive-thru.js aim / menuTick). The items, names and
 * prices on the pictures are the game's own menus in restaurants.js, item for item; ITEMS below says where each one is
 * on its picture (left, top, right, bottom as parts of the picture's width and height). The same pictures are on the
 * lit boards on the buildings (city-drive-thru.js). */
